    "detailed_description": "<h1>JOIN US ON DISCORD</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>Wishlist To Stay Notified<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2440720/extras/db9a877e030b5d9f1b242f069e8cf6c8.poster.avif?t=1734879345\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2440720/extras/db9a877e030b5d9f1b242f069e8cf6c8.webm?t=1734879345\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2440720/extras/db9a877e030b5d9f1b242f069e8cf6c8.mp4?t=1734879345\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About Armored Souls</h2>Armored Souls is a top-down Soulslike Action game with Roguelike elements and challenging boss fights set in a machine-driven dystopia.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Combat</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2440720/extras/29d75306cb23b0381d163a12f543e7e4.poster.avif?t=1734879345\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2440720/extras/29d75306cb23b0381d163a12f543e7e4.webm?t=1734879345\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2440720/extras/29d75306cb23b0381d163a12f543e7e4.mp4?t=1734879345\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Motherboard System</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2440720/extras/52c94613e9c113d517b060a26bda52a2.poster.avif?t=1734879345\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2440720/extras/52c94613e9c113d517b060a26bda52a2.webm?t=1734879345\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2440720/extras/52c94613e9c113d517b060a26bda52a2.mp4?t=1734879345\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Features:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> <strong>Battle:</strong> Fight your way through hostile environments overrun by powerful machines.<br></li><li> <strong>Scavenge:</strong> Collect parts and harvest resources for your mechanical upgrades.<br></li><li> <strong>Forge:</strong> Acquire enemy technology to assemble new, powerful weapons.<br></li><li> <strong>Evolve:</strong> Earn experience and unlock passive skills based on your playstyle.<br></li><li> <strong>Synergize:</strong> Combine a wide variety of offensive skills and support programs to take down powerful bosses.<br></li><li> <strong>Be a machine:</strong> Design your attack patterns with powerful macros and auto modes to achieve maximum efficiency. Bip.</li></ul>",
