am/apps/2440720/extras/52c94613e9c113d517b060a26bda52a2.mp4?t=1734879345\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Features:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> <strong>Battle:</strong> Fight your way through hostile environments overrun by powerful machines.<br></li><li> <strong>Scavenge:</strong> Collect parts and harvest resources for your mechanical upgrades.<br></li><li> <strong>Forge:</strong> Acquire enemy technology to assemble new, powerful weapons.<br></li><li> <strong>Evolve:</strong> Earn experience and unlock passive skills based on your playstyle.<br></li><li> <strong>Synergize:</strong> Combine a wide variety of offensive skills and support programs to take down powerful bosses.<br></li><li> <strong>Be a machine:</strong> Design your attack patterns with powerful macros and auto modes to achieve maximum efficiency. Bip.</li></ul>",
